elp me?","ви можете мені допомогти?","vih MOH-zheh-teh meh-NEE doh-poh-moh-HTIH"],["where is the toilet?","де туалет?","deh too-ah-LET"],["how much is it?","скільки це коштує?","SKEEL'-kih tseh KOSH-too-yeh"],["I would like...","я хотів би...","yah khoh-TEEV bih"],["I need...","мені потрібно...","meh-NEE poh-TREEB-noh"],["I am lost","я заблукав","yah zah-bloo-KAHV"],["what is this?","що це?","shchoh tseh"],["I do not know","я не знаю","yah neh ZNAH-yoo"],["that is OK","нічого","nee-CHOH-hoh"]]},{"id":"formal-and-informal","title":"Formal and informal","items":[["how are you? (informal)","як ти?","yahk tih"],["how are you? (formal)","як ви?","yahk vih"],["what is your name? (informal)","як тебе звати?","yahk teh-BEH ZVAH-tih"],["what is your name? (formal)","як вас звати?","yahk vahs ZVAH-tih"],["do you speak English? (informal)","ти говориш англійською?","tih hoh-VOH-rihsh ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"],["do you speak English? (formal)","ви говорите англійською?","vih hoh-VOH-rih-teh ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"],["can you help me? (informal)","допоможеш мені?","doh-poh-MOH-zhesh meh-NEE"],["can you help me? (formal)","допоможіть мені, будь ласка","doh-poh-moh-ZHEET meh-NEE bood' LAHS-kah"],["hi (informal)","привіт","prih-VEET"],["good day (formal)","добрий день","DOH-brihy den'"],["bye (informal)","бувай","boo-VAHY"],["goodbye (formal)","до побачення","doh poh-BAH-chen-nya"]],"note":"ти (informal): friends, family, children, young people. ви (formal): strangers, older people, teachers, shops. ви is also the plural \"you\". Use ви when unsure."},{"id":"survival","title":"Survival","items":[["I understand","я розумію","yah roh-zoo-MEE-yoo"],["I speak a little Ukrainian","я трошки розмовляю українською","yah TROSH-kih roz-moh-VLYAH-yoo oo-krah-YEEN-s'koh-yoo"],["please repeat","повторіть, будь ласка","pov-toh-REET bood' LAHS-kah"],["what does... mean?","що означає...?","shchoh oh-znah-CHAH-yeh"],["please write it down","напишіть, будь ласка","nah-pih-SHEET bood' LAHS-kah"],["help!","допоможіть!","doh-poh-moh-ZHEET"],["I need help","мені потрібна допомога","meh-NEE poh-TREEB-nah doh-poh-MOH-hah"]]},{"id":"getting-around","title":"Getting around","items":[["where is...?","де...?","deh"],["where is the station?","де вокзал?","deh vok-ZAHL"],["turn left","поверніть ліворуч","poh-vehr-NEET lee-voh-ROOCH"],["turn right","поверніть праворуч","poh-vehr-NEET prah-voh-ROOCH"],["straight ahead","прямо","PRYAH-moh"],["near","близько","BLIZ'-ko"],["far","далеко","dah-leh-KOH"],["how far is it?","як далеко це?","yahk dah-leh-KOH tseh"],["a ticket to Kyiv, please","квиток до Києва, будь ласка","kvih-TOK doh KIH-yeh-vah bood' LAHS-kah"],["what time does the train leave?","о котрій відправляється поїзд?","oh koht-REEY veed-prahv-LYAH-yet-sya POH-yeezd"],["to the airport, please","до аеропорту, будь ласка","doh ah-eh-roh-POR-too bood' LAHS-kah"],["stop here, please","зупиніться тут, будь ласка","zoo-pee-NEET-sya toot bood' LAHS-kah"]]},{"id":"eating-out","title":"Eating out","items":[["a table for two, please","столик на двох, будь ласка","STOH-lihk nah dvokh bood' LAHS-kah"],["the menu, please","меню, будь ласка","meh-NYOO bood' LAHS-kah"],["I will have this","я візьму це","yah veez'-MOO tseh"],["water, please","води, будь ласка","voh-DIH bood' LAHS-kah"],["the bill, please","рахунок, будь ласка","rah-KHOO-nok bood' LAHS-kah"],["it is delicious","дуже смачно","DOO-zheh SMAHCH-noh"],["I am hungry","я голодний","yah hoh-LOD-nihy"],["I am thirsty","я хочу пити","yah khoh-CHOO PIH-tih"],["I am vegetarian","я вегетаріанець","yah veh-heh-tah-ree-AH-nets'"],["I am allergic to nuts","у мене алергія на горіхи","oo MEH-neh ah-lehr-HEE-ya nah hoh-REE-khih"],["no meat, please","без м'яса, будь ласка","bez MYAH-sah bood' LAHS-kah"],["another one, please","ще один, будь ласка","shcheh oh-DEEN bood' LAHS-kah"]]},{"id":"shopping","title":"Shopping","items":[["how much is this?","скільки це коштує?","SKEEL'-kih tseh KOSH-too-yeh"],["it is too expensive","це занадто дорого","tseh zah-NAHD-toh DOH-roh-hoh"],["do you have a smaller size?","у вас є менший розмір?","oo vahs ye MEN-shihy roz-MEER"],["I am just looking","я просто дивлюся","yah PROS-toh dihv-LYOO-sya"],["I will take it","я це беру","yah tseh beh-ROO"],["can I pay by card?","можна карткою?","MOZH-nah KAHRT-koh-yoo"],["cash","готівка","hoh-TEEV-kah"],["a bag, please","пакет, будь ласка","pah-KET bood' LAHS-kah"],["open","відчинено","veed-CHIH-neh-noh"],["closed","зачинено","zah-CHIH-neh-noh"]]},{"id":"hotel-and-travel","title":"Hotel and travel","items":[["I have a reservation","я бронював номер","yah broh-nyoo-VAHV NOH-mehr"],["a room for one night","номер на одну ніч","NOH-mehr nah od-NOO neech"],["what time is breakfast?","о котрій сніданок?","oh koht-REEY snee-DAH-nok"],["the key, please","ключ, будь ласка","klyooch bood' LAHS-kah"],["is there wifi?","є вайфай?","ye vahy-FAHY"],["my passport","мій паспорт","meey PAHS-port"],["my luggage","мій багаж","meey bah-HAHZH"],["I would like to change money","я хочу обміняти гроші","yah khoh-CHOO ob-mee-NYAH-tih HROH-shee"]]},{"id":"health-and-emergency","title":"Health and emergency","items":[["I feel sick","мені погано","meh-NEE poh-HAH-noh"],["I need a doctor","мені потрібен лікар","meh-NEE poh-TREE-ben LEE-kahr"],["call an ambulance","викличте швидку","VIHK-lihch-teh shvihd-KOO"],["it hurts here","тут болить","toot boh-LIHT"],["I have a headache","у мене болить голова","oo MEH-neh boh-LIHT hoh-loh-VAH"],["I have a fever","у мене температура","oo MEH-neh tem-peh-rah-TOO-rah"],["where is the pharmacy?","де аптека?","deh ahp-TEH-kah"],["call the police","викличте поліцію","VIHK-lihch-teh poh-LEE-tsee-yoo"],["my phone was stolen","в мене вкрали телефон","v MEH-neh VKRAH-lih teh-leh-FON"]]},{"id":"chatting","title":"Chatting","items":[["what do you do?","ким ти працюєш?","kihm tih prah-TSYOO-yesh"],["I am a student","я студент","yah stoo-DENT"],["I am a teacher","я вчитель","yah VCHIH-tel'"],["I live in Tashkent","я живу в Ташкенті","yah z