","відповідати","veed-poh-vee-DAH-tih"],["to repeat","повторювати","pov-toh-ryoo-VAH-tih"],["to understand","розуміти","roh-zoo-MEE-tih"],["to remember","пам'ятати","pah-myah-TAH-tih"],["to forget","забувати","zah-boo-VAH-tih"],["to explain","пояснювати","poh-yahs-nyoo-VAH-tih"],["to practise","тренуватися","treh-noo-VAH-tih-sya"],["to pass an exam","скласти іспит","SKLAHS-tih EES-pit"],["to fail an exam","провалити іспит","proh-vah-LIH-tih EES-pit"],["to write down","записувати","zah-PIH-soo-vah-tih"],["to listen","слухати","SLOO-khah-tih"],["to read aloud","читати вголос","chih-TAH-tih VHO-lohs"],["to think","думати","DOO-mah-tih"],["to count","рахувати","rah-khoo-VAH-tih"],["to spell","вимовляти по буквах","vih-mov-LYAH-tih poh BOOK-vahkh"],["to translate","перекладати","peh-reh-klah-DAH-tih"],["to graduate","закінчити навчання","zah-KEEN-chih-tih nahv-CHAHN-nya"]]}],"grammar":[{"id":"pronouns","title":"Pronouns","text":["Ukrainian often drops the pronoun, but learn them. ви is both formal \"you\" and plural \"you\"."],"rows":[["I","я","yah"],["you (informal)","ти","tih"],["he","він","veen"],["she","вона","voh-NAH"],["it","воно","voh-NOH"],["we","ми","mih"],["you (formal / plural)","ви","vih"],["they","вони","voh-NIH"]],"ex":[["I am a student","я студент","yah stoo-DENT"],["you are tall","ти високий","tih vih-SOH-kihy"],["she is my sister","вона моя сестра","voh-NAH moh-YAH sehs-TRAH"],["we are friends","ми друзі","mih DROO-zee"],["they are teachers","вони вчителі","voh-NIH VCHIH-teh-lee"]]},{"id":"singular-and-plural","title":"Singular and plural","text":["Masculine: add -и or -і (or -ы after hard consonants). Feminine -а → -и. Neuter -о → -а. Some words are irregular."],"rows":[["masculine","стіл → столи","steel → stoh-LIH"],["masculine","брат → брати","braht → BRAH-tih"],["feminine","книга → книги","KNIH-hah → KNIH-hih"],["feminine (soft)","неділя → неділі","neh-DEE-lya → neh-DEE-lee"],["neuter","вікно → вікна","veek-NOH → VEEK-nah"],["irregular","людина → люди","lyoo-DIH-nah → LYOO-dih"]],"ex":[["one table, tables","стіл, столи","steel stoh-LIH"],["one book, books","книга, книги","KNIH-hah KNIH-hih"],["one window, windows","вікно, вікна","veek-NOH VEEK-nah"],["one friend, friends","друг, друзі","drooh DROO-zee"],["one child, children","дитина, діти","dih-TIH-nah DEE-tih"]]},{"id":"to-be","title":"Бути: to be","text":["In the present tense \"to be\" is usually dropped: Я студент. (I am a student). Use є for \"there is\" or for emphasis."],"rows":[["I am","я є / (omitted)","yah ye"],["you are","ти є / (omitted)","tih ye"],["he / she is","він / вона є / (omitted)","veen ye"],["we are","ми є / (omitted)","mih ye"],["they are","вони є / (omitted)","voh-NIH ye"]],"ex":[["I am English","я англієць","yah ahn-HLEE-yets'"],["he is a doctor","він лікар","veen LEE-kahr"],["we are tired","ми втомлені","mih VTOM-leh-nee"],["are you from Kyiv?","ти з Києва?","tih z KIH-yeh-vah"],["they are at home","вони вдома","voh-NIH VDOH-mah"]]},{"id":"to-have","title":"Мати: to have","text":["Usually said as \"at me there is\": У мене є."],"rows":[["I have","у мене є","oo MEH-neh ye"],["you have","у тебе є","oo TEH-beh ye"],["he has","у нього є","oo NYOH-hoh ye"],["she has","у неї є","oo neh-YEE ye"],["we have","у нас є","oo nahs ye"],["they have","у них є","oo nihkh ye"]],"ex":[["I have a brother","у мене є брат","oo MEH-neh ye braht"],["she has two cats","у неї два коти","oo neh-YEE dvah koh-TIH"],["we have time","у нас є час","oo nahs ye chahs"],["do you have a pen?","у тебе є ручка?","oo TEH-beh ye ROOCH-kah"],["they have a car","у них є машина","oo nihkh ye mah-SHIH-nah"]]},{"id":"regular-verbs-present-tense","title":"Regular verbs (present tense)","text":["Verbs end in -ти. Many have -ю, -єш, -є, -ємо, -єте, -ють. Працювати (to work):"],"rows":[["я","працюю","prah-TSYOO-yoo"],["ти","працюєш","prah-TSYOO-yesh"],["він / вона","працює","prah-TSYOO-yeh"],["ми","працюємо","prah-TSYOO-yeh-moh"],["ви","працюєте","prah-TSYOO-yeh-teh"],["вони","працюють","prah-TSYOO-yoot'"]],"ex":[["I work in a bank","я працюю в банку","yah prah-TSYOO-yoo v BAHN-koo"],["you live in Kyiv","ти живеш у Києві","tih zhih-VESH oo KIH-yeh-vee"],["she reads a book","вона читає книгу","voh-NAH chih-TAH-yeh KNIH-hoo"],["we learn Ukrainian","ми вчимо українську","mih VCHIH-moh oo-krah-YEEN-s'koo"],["they buy bread","вони купують хліб","voh-NIH koo-POO-yoot' khleeb"]]},{"id":"to-go","title":"Йти: to go","text":["By transport: їхати (їду, їдеш...). Йти is on foot."],"rows":[["I go","я йду","yah ydoo"],["you go","ти йдеш","tih ydesh"],["he / she goes","він йде","veen YDEH"],["we go","ми йдемо","mih YDEH-moh"],["you go (pl)","ви йдете","vih YDEH-teh"],["they go","вони йдуть","voh-NIH ydoot'"]],"ex":[["I am going to school","я йду до школи","yah ydoo doh SHKOH-lih"],["where are you going?","куди ти йдеш?","koo-DIH tih ydesh"],["we are going home","ми йдемо додому","mih YDEH-moh doh-DOH-moo"],["she is going shopping","вона йде за покупками","voh-NAH YDEH zah poh-KOOP-kah-mih"],["let's go!","ходімо!","khoh-DEE-moh"]]},{"id":"basic-sentences","title":"Basic sentences","text":["Word order is flexible: usually subject, verb, object. Adjectives come before the noun and agree with it."],"rows":[["subject + verb + object","Я їм хліб.","yah yeem khleeb"],["adjective before noun","великий будинок","veh-LIH-kihy boo-DIH-nok"],["add time or place","Я працюю тут сьогодні.","yah prah-TSYOO-yoo toot s'oh-HOD-nee"]],"ex":[["I eat bread","я їм хліб","yah yeem khleeb"],["Anna reads a book","Анна читає книгу","AHN-nah chih-TAH-yeh KNIH-hoo"],["we live in a big house","ми живемо у великому будинку","mih zhih-VEH-moh oo veh-LIH-koh-moo boo-DIN-koo"],["he works here today","він сьогодні працює тут","veen s'oh-HOD-nee prah-TSYOO-yeh toot"],["the dog is black","собака чорна","soh-BAH-kah CHOR-nah"]]},{"id":"negation","title":"Negation","text":["Put не before the verb. Double negatives are normal: Я нічого не хочу.","Put не before the verb. Double negatives are normal: я нічого не хочу. \"There is not\" = немає + genitive: немає часу. The object after a negative verb is often genitive (я маю машину → я не маю машини)."],"rows":[["not","не + verb","neh"],["nothing","нічого","nee-CHOH-hoh"],["nobody","ніхто","nee-KHTOH"],["never","ніколи","nee-KOH-lih"],["не + verb","не говорю","neh hoh-voh-RYOO"],["there is not","немає","neh-MAH-yeh"],["nothing","нічого","nee-CHOH-hoh"],["nobody","ніхто","nee-KHTOH"],["never","ніколи","nee-KOH-lih"]],"ex":[["I want","я хочу","yah KHOH-choo"],["I do not want","я не хочу","yah neh KHOH-choo"],["I speak English","я говорю англійською","yah hoh-voh-RYOO ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"],["I do not speak English","я не говорю англійською","yah neh hoh-voh-RYOO ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"],["I like it","мені це подобається","meh-NEE tseh poh-DOH-bah-yet-sya"],["I do not like it","мені це не подобається","meh-NEE tseh neh poh-DOH-bah-yet-sya"],["she is here","вона тут","voh-NAH toot"],["she is not here","її тут немає","yeh-YEE toot neh-MAH-yeh"],["I have a car","у мене є машина","oo MEH-neh ye mah-SHIH-nah"],["I do not have a car","у мене немає машини","oo MEH-neh neh-MAH-yeh mah-SHIH-nih"],["I understand","я розумію","yah roh-zoo-MEE-yoo"],["I do not understand","я не розумію","yah neh roh-zoo-MEE-yoo"],["we are tired","ми втомилися","mih vtoh-MIH-lih-sya"],["we are not tired","ми не втомилися","mih neh vtoh-MIH-lih-sya"],["he works on Sundays","він працює в неділю","veen prah-TSYOO-yeh v neh-DEE-lyoo"],["he does not work on Sundays","він не працює в неділю","veen neh prah-TSYOO-yeh v neh-DEE-lyoo"]]},{"id":"asking-questions","title":"Asking questions","text":["Yes or no: raise your voice, or start with чи."],"rows":[["statement","Ти говориш англійською.","tih hoh-VOH-rihsh ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"],["question with чи","Чи ти говориш англійською?","chih tih hoh-VOH-rihsh ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"],["rising voice","Ти говориш англійською?","tih hoh-VOH-rihsh ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"]],"ex":[["do you speak English?","чи ти говориш англійською?","chih tih hoh-VOH-rihsh ahn-HLEEY-s'koh-yoo"],["is she a doctor?","чи вона лікар?","chih voh-NAH LEE-kahr"],["do you have a pen?","чи є в тебе ручка?","chih ye v TEH-beh ROOCH-kah"],["are you tired?","ти втомився?","tih vtoh-MIH-vsya"],["is it far?","це далеко?","tseh dah-leh-KOH"]]},{"id":"question-words","title":"Question words","text":[],"rows":[["what","що","shchoh"],["who","хто","khtoh"],["where","де","deh"],["when","коли","koh-LIH"],["why","чому","choh-MOO"],["how","як","yahk"],["which","який","yah-KIHY"],["how much / how many","скільки","SKEEL'-kih"]],"ex":[["what is this?","що це?","shchoh tseh"],["who is she?","хто вона?","khtoh voh-NAH"],["where do you live?","де ти живеш?","deh tih zhih-VESH"],["when is the exam?","коли іспит?","koh-LIH EES-pit"],["why are you late?","чому ти запізнився?","choh-MOO tih zah-peez-NIH-vsya"],["how much is it?","скільки це коштує?","SKEEL'-kih tseh KOSH-too-yeh"]]},{"id":"possessives","title":"Possessives","text":[],"rows":[["my","мій / моя / моє","meey / moh-YAH / moh-YEH"],["your (informal)","твій / твоя / твоє","tveey / tvoh-YAH / tvoh-YEH"],["his","його","yoh-HOH"],["her","її","yeh-YEE"],["our","наш / наша / наше","nahsh / NAH-shah / NAH-sheh"],["your (formal / plural)","ваш / ваша / ваше","vahsh / VAH-shah / VAH-sheh"],["their","їхній / їхня / їхнє","YEEKH-neey"]],"ex":[["my house","мій дім","meey deem"],["your friends","твої друзі","tvoh-YEE DROO-zee"],["his sister","його сестра","yoh-HOH sehs-TRAH"],["our teacher","наш вчитель","nahsh VCHIH-tel'"],["my mother","моя мама","moh-YAH MAH-mah"]]},{"id":"formal-vs-informal","title":"Formal vs informal","text":["ти for friends, family and children. ви for strangers, elders, teachers, and always for more than one person. Add the name and patronymic when you want to be very polite."],"rows":[["you, informal","ти","tih"],["you, formal / plural","ви","vih"],["your, informal","твій","tveey"],["your, formal","ваш","vahsh"]],"ex":[["you speak (informal)","ти говориш","tih hoh-VOH-rihsh"],["you speak (formal)","ви говорите","vih hoh-VOH-rih-teh"],["how are you? (informal)","як ти?","yahk tih"],["how are you? (formal)","як ви?","yahk vih"],["thank you, Mr Ivanenko","дякую, пане Іваненко","DYAH-koo-yoo PAH-neh ee-vah-NEN-koh"]]},{"id":"past-and-future-simple","title":"Past and future (simple)","text":["Past: stem + -в (masculine), -ла (feminine), -ло (neuter), -ли (plural). Future: буду + infinitive."],"rows":[["I worked (m)","я працював","yah prah-tsyoo-VAHV"],["I worked (f)","я працювала","yah prah-tsyoo-VAH-lah"],["we worked","ми працювали","mih prah-tsyoo-VAH-lih"],["I will work","я буду працювати","yah BOO-doo prah-tsyoo-VAH-tih"]],"ex":[["yesterday I worked (m)","вчора я працював","VCHOH-rah yah prah-tsyoo-VAHV"],["she bought a book","вона купила книгу","voh-NAH koo-PIH-lah KNIH-hoo"],["I went home (m)","я пішов додому","yah pee-SHOV doh-DOH-moo"],["I will call you tomorrow","я зателефоную завтра","yah zah-teh-leh-FOH-noo-yoo ZAHV-trah"],["we will eat at eight","ми їстимемо о восьмій","mih YEES-tih-meh-moh oh vos'-MEEY"]]},{"id":"commands","title":"Commands","text":["Informal (ти): drop -ти and add -й or the stem: читай! (read), йди! (go). Plural / polite (ви): add -те: читайте!, ідіть!. Negative: не + the same form (не читай!)."],"rows":[["read!","читай!","chih-TAHY"],["read! (plural / polite)","читайте!","chih-TAHY-teh"],["do not read!","не читай!","neh chih-TAHY"]],"ex":[["come here","іди сюди","ee-DIH syoo-DIH"],["do not come here","не йди сюди","neh ydih syoo-DIH"],["sit down","сідай","see-DAHY"],["do not sit down","не сідай","neh see-DAHY"],["be quiet","мовчи","mov-CHIH"],["do not be late","не запізнюйся","neh zah-PEEZ-nyooy-sya"],["open the door","відчини двері","veed-chih-NIH DVEH-ree"],["close the window","закрий вікно","zah-KRIHY veek-NOH"],["listen to me","послухай мене","poh-SLOO-khahy meh-NEH"],["do not worry","не хвилюйся","neh khvih-LYOOY-sya"],["speak slowly","говори повільно","hoh-voh-RIH poh-VEEL'-noh"],["wait a moment","зачекай хвилинку","zah-cheh-KAHY khvih-LIHN-koo"]]},{"id":"can-must-want","title":"Can, must, want","text":["могти (can), мусити / треба (must), хотіти (want) + infinitive: я можу плавати, я мушу йти, я хочу їсти. Не можна = you must not; не треба = no need."],"rows":[["I can","я можу","yah MOH-zhoo"],["I must","я мушу","yah MOO-shoo"],["I want","я хочу","yah KHOH-choo"]],"ex":[["I can swim","я вмію плавати","yah VMEE-yoo PLAH-vah-tih"],["I cannot swim","я не вмію плавати","yah neh VMEE-yoo PLAH-vah-tih"],["can you help me?","ти можеш мені допомогти?","tih MOH-zhesh meh-NEE doh-poh-moh-HTIH"],["we must go","ми мусимо йти","mih MOO-sih-moh ytih"],["we must not go","нам не можна йти","nahm neh MOZH-nah ytih"],["I want to eat","я хочу їсти","yah KHOH-choo YEES-tih"],["I do not want to eat","я не хочу їсти","yah neh KHOH-choo YEES-tih"],["you can come","ти можеш прийти","tih MOH-zhesh prihy-TIH"],["you cannot come","ти не можеш прийти","tih neh MOH-zhesh prihy-TIH"],["she wants to study","вона хоче вчитися","voh-NAH KHOH-cheh VCHIH-tih-sya"],["I must work today","я мушу працювати сьогодні","yah MOO-shoo prah-tsyoo-VAH-tih s'oh-HOD-nee"],["you must not run","не можна бігати","neh MOZH-nah BEE-hah-tih"]]},{"id":"in-on-at","title":"In, on, at","text":["у / в = in / at; на = on; під = under; біля = next to; поруч з = beside; близько від = near; о дев'ятій = at nine. After в and на the place takes the locative: у школі, на столі."],"rows":[["in / at","у / в","oo / v"],["on","на","nah"],["under","під","peed"],["next to","біля","BEE-lya"]],"ex":[["the book is on the table","книга на столі","KNIH-hah nah stoh-LEE"],["the cat is under the table","кіт під столом","keet peed STOH-lom"],["I am at school","я у школі","yah oo SHKOH-lee"],["I am at home","я вдома","yah VDOH-mah"],["the shop is next to the bank","магазин біля банку","mah-hah-ZIHN BEE-lya BAHN-koo"],["the park is near the station","парк близько від вокзалу","pahrk BLIZ'-ko veed vok-ZAH-loo"],["we meet in the morning","ми зустрічаємося вранці","mih zoos-tree-CHAH-yeh-moh-sya VRAHN-tsee"],["the lesson is at nine","урок о дев'ятій","oo-ROK oh deh-VYAH-teey"],["the key is in the bag","ключ у сумці","klyooch oo SOOM-tsee"]]},{"id":"comparing-things","title":"Comparing things","text":["Add -іший / -ший to the adjective (більший = bigger) or use більш + adjective. The most = найбільший / найкращий. \"Than\" = ніж or genitive: вищий за мене."],"rows":[["bigger","більший","BEEL'-shihy"],["the biggest","найбільший","nahy-BEEL'-shihy"],["than","ніж / за","neezh / zah"]],"ex":[["big, bigger, the biggest","великий, більший, найбільший","veh-LIH-kihy BEEL'-shihy nahy-BEEL'-shihy"],["small, smaller, the smallest","малий, менший, найменший","mah-LIHY MEN-shihy nahy-MEN-shihy"],["this is better than that","це краще, ніж те","tseh KRAH-shcheh neezh teh"],["this is worse than that","це гірше, ніж те","tseh HEER-sheh neezh teh"],["she is taller than me","вона вища за мене","voh-NAH VIH-shchah zah MEH-neh"],["Tashkent is bigger than Samarkand","Ташкент більший за Самарканд","tahsh-KENT BEEL'-shihy zah sah-mar-KAHND"],["it is the cheapest","це найдешевше","tseh nahy-deh-SHEV-sheh"],["the same as","такий самий, як","tah-KIHY SAH-mihy yahk"]]},{"id":"everyday-sentences","title":"Everyday sentences","text":["Extra practice with the most useful patterns."],"rows":[],"ex":[["he is a teacher","він вчитель","veen VCHIH-tel'"],["you (plural) are students","ви студенти","vih stoo-DEN-tih"],["I am happy","я щасливий","yah shchahs-LIH-vihy"],["she is at school","вона в школі","voh-NAH v SHKOH-lee"],["you are my friend","ти мій друг","tih meey drooh"],["it is cold","холодно","KHOH-lod-noh"],["I study English","я вивчаю англійську","yah vihv-CHAH-yoo ahn-HLEEY-s'koo"],["he teaches maths","він викладає математику","veen vihk-lah-DAH-yeh mah-teh-MAH-tih-koo"],["they work every day","вони працюють щодня","voh-NIH prah-TSYOO-yoot' shchohd-NYAH"],["is this your book?","це твоя книга?","tseh tvoh-YAH KNIH-hah"],["are they here?","вони тут?","voh-NIH toot"],["do you like tea?","ти любиш чай?","tih LYOO-bihsh chahy"],["what time is it?","котра година?","koht-RAH hoh-DIH-nah"],["whose book is this?","чия це книга?","chih-YAH tseh KNIH-hah"],["how old are you?","скільки тобі років?","SKEEL'-kih toh-BEE ROH-keev"],["how do you say it?","як це сказати?","yahk tseh skah-ZAH-tih"],["your book (formal)","ваша книга","VAH-shah KNIH-hah"],["their house","їхній дім","YEEKH-neey deem"],["my phone","мій телефон","meey teh-leh-FON"],["excuse me, sir","вибачте, пане","VIH-bahch-teh PAH-neh"],["please sit down (formal)","сідайте, будь ласка","see-DAHY-teh bood' LAHS-kah"],["come here (informal)","іди сюди","ee-DIH syoo-DIH"],["yesterday I was tired","вчора я був втомлений","VCHOH-rah yah booh VTOM-leh-nihy"],["I will study tomorrow","завтра я буду вчитися","ZAHV-trah yah BOO-doo VCHIH-tih-sya"],["we went to the park","ми пішли в парк","mih peesh-LIH v pahrk"]]}],"name":"Ukrainian","id":"uk","flag":"ua","note":""}